    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38835" root="ملأَ" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْأَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>manner in which a thing is filled.</i>
(K.) [You say,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ لَحَسَنُ المِلْأَةِ</span> (not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّمَلُّؤِ</span>)
<i>Verily it is well filled.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْأَةٌ</span> <i>An oppression occasioned by repletion with food.</i> (K, TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلَآءَةٌ</span>.]

